  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For complete combustion of methanol</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;the amount of heat produced as measured by bomb calorimeter is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>726</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The enthalpy of combustion for the reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is<br />integer)<br />(Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>JK</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "727",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>For chemical reaction :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#916;n</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></msub><mi>RT</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>726</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>727</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>245</mn><mi>KJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>727</mn></math></p>",
